# Nigerian Waste Dataset

A labeled image dataset of common Nigerian waste items for training object detection models in automated waste segregation systems. Developed as part of the **Sortify** project.

**Dataset link:** [Roboflow Universe](https://universe.roboflow.com/rosemary-xt27v/final-year-project-ni3b6)
**Version:** v2 (exported 2026-07-16)
**License:** CC BY 4.0

---

